public static int findLargest(int[] arr) {
    if (arr == null || arr.length == 0) {
        throw new IllegalArgumentException("Array is empty");
    }

    int largest = Integer.MIN_VALUE;

    for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
        if (arr[i] > largest) {
            largest = arr[i];
        }
    }
    return largest;
}
--- 
IllegalArgumentException kya hai?

Ye runtime exception hai (unchecked exception)

Jab hum method ko galat input dete hain tab use hoti hai
throw keyword ka role

throw ka matlab:
👉 “Yahin se error fek do, aage code mat chalao”
